							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Daemii, sometimes you can&#039;t help but take these posts serious because people get slammed.  Sometimes they derserve it..sometimes they get the slam because the people that post are angry folkes and haven&#039;t gotten what they want so...why not slam someone else.<br /><br />Its easier on your self esteem to do it that a way.<br /><br />Anyway, thanks ya&#039;all for reading all of our two coppers.   <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /><br /><br /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /> </td>
