							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Yes, Vand sounds like a lack,&nbsp; of a sense of humor.&nbsp; &nbsp;<br /><br />Then, what might you expect from a necro who likes to kill druids&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm13.gif" alt="cwm13" border="0" /><br /><br /></td>
